stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Active
  Active --> Suspended
  Suspended --> Active
  Active --> Renewed
  Renewed --> [*]
  Draft --> Cancelled
  Active --> Cancelled
  Suspended --> Cancelled
  Cancelled --> [*]
  note right of Active
    needs MRR above zero
  end note
  note right of Cancelled
    needs a cancellation reason<br/>cannot be reactivated
  end note
